{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05557","headline":"同望幸新亭赐钱公宴 · 李憕","name":"同望幸新亭赐钱公宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"感梦通玄化，覃恩降紫宸。\n赐钱开汉府，分帛醉尧人。\n地隔朝宗庆，亭临卜洛新。\n行看广云雨，二月次东巡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李憕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05557.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05557","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}